# Lassoed by the Law {3}{W}, ruling 2024-04-12: "If Lassoed by the Law leaves the battlefield before its first triggered
# ability resolves, the target permanent won't be exiled at all." (CR 610.3b) Bot1 casts it on turn three and aims the exile
# trigger at Bot2's Ornithopter; with both triggers on the stack Bot2 destroys the enchantment with Disenchant. The exile
# trigger then does nothing: the Ornithopter stays in play. The second trigger is its own ability, so Bot1 still gets the Mercenary.

